<header class="hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="pill" style="background:#ffffff20;color:#dffaff">DOCUMENT-DRIVEN REPORT BUILDER</span><h1 class="mt-3">Turn your documents into<br><span style="color:#77e3e3">professional reports.</span></h1><p class="mt-3 mb-0">Upload your source materials, choose the report type and requirements, then build a structured report you can edit, download or print.</p></div></header>
