</div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-4"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="back1"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Back</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="to3">Review report <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i></button></div></section>
<section id="step3" class="hidden"><span class="pill">STEP 03</span><h2 class="section-title mt-3">Review your report structure</h2><p class="sub">Check the extracted source text and proposed sections before generating the editable report.</p><div id="reviewSummary" class="info mb-3"></div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3"><span class="pill" id="sourceCount">0 source files</span><span class="pill" id="wordCount">0 extracted words</span><span class="pill">No AI API / no database</span></div><div class="preview" id="sourcePreview"></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-4"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="back2"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Back</button><button class="btn btn-success" id="generate"><i class="bi bi-magic me-1"></i>Generate report</button></div></section>
<section id="step4" class="hidden"><span class="pill">STEP 04</span><h2 class="section-title mt-3">Your report is ready to review</h2><p class="sub">Edit the report directly below, then download an editable Word-compatible document or print / save as PDF.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 no-print mb-3"><button class="btn btn-primary" id="download"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-word me-1"></i>Download report</button><button class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="print"><i class="bi bi-printer me-1"></i>Print / Save PDF</button><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="regenerate"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-1"></i>Rebuild</button></div><div id="report" class="report-page" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="true"></div><div class="info mt-3 no-print"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-1"></i>You can click inside the report and edit any text before downloading or printing. Review all highlighted missing-information prompts and replace them with verified details.</div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-4 no-print"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="back3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Back</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="newReport">Start new report</button></div></section>
